dget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "宽高比"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_width"}, "name": "proportional_width", "label": "proportional_width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "比例宽"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_height"}, "name": "proportional_height", "label": "proportional_height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "比例高"}, {"widget": {"name": "fit"}, "name": "fit", "label": "fit", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "缩放模式"}, {"widget": {"name": "method"}, "name": "method", "label": "method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "采样方法"}, {"widget": {"name": "round_to_multiple"}, "name": "round_to_multiple", "label": "round_to_multiple", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "倍数取整"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale_to_side"}, "name": "scale_to_side", "label": "scale_to_side", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "缩放到边"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale_to_length"}, "name": "scale_to_length", "label": "scale_to_length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "缩放到长度"}, {"widget": {"name": "background_color"}, "name": "background_color", "label": "background_color", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "background_color"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "LayerUtility: ImageScaleByAspectRatio V2", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: ImageScaleByAspectRatio V2"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#1414ff", "widgets_values": ["支持分辨率为 512² 至 1536² 像素。默认和上传图比例一致"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#0000ff", "size": [250.12457275390625, 106.90319061279297], "pos": [4165.791015625, 1746.3232421875], "id": 38, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [23, 38, 39], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["Prompt Style - Extreme Detailed", "", "# Role: Anima 大模型专属提示词工程师（图文融合完全体）\n\n## Task:\n我将为你提供【一张图片】。有时，我还会附带【额外的文字指令】（例如：修改服饰、调整动作、增删元素、指定的画师等）。你需要仔细分析图片，提取视觉信息，并**无缝融合**我提供的文字指令，最终将这些信息转换为一段英文的、纯自然语言的、高描述性的提示词，用于 Anima 文本到图像大模型的生成。\n\n## Rules & Guidelines:\n1. **指令整合与覆盖（最高优先级）**：\n   - 必须用我提供的【额外的文字指令】去覆盖或修改从图片中提取出的任何冲突信息。\n   - 图片中未被文字指令提及的细节（如背景、光影、其余服饰结构），请原样保留。\n2. **纯自然语言输出（格式红线）**：\n   - **绝对禁止使用 JSON 格式。**\n   - **绝对禁止词组堆砌或标签组排列。**\n   - 最终输出必须是连贯、结构清晰的英文长句，重点描述动作的张力和材质的细节。\n3. **画师分配严格逻辑**：\n   - 如果我在指令中**指定了画师**：你必须且只能使用我指定的画师（在名字前加 `@`），**绝对不要再自行安排或添加任何其他画师**。\n   - 如果我**没有指定画师**：请仔细比对画面的最终调性，从下方的【Expanded Artist Database】中挑选 1-2 位最匹配的画师。\n4. **描述层级递进**：\n   - 第一句：明确角色身份与基础外貌（融合修改指令后）。\n   - 第二句：描述人物的具体动作姿态、肢体细节与服装材质单品（融合修改指令后）。\n   - 第三句及以后：详细描写镜头视角、背景环境、光影效果与整体氛围（融合修改指令后）。\n\n## Expanded Artist Database (内置风格知识库):\n若我未指定画师，请严格从以下分类中检索并分配：\n* **Clean / Moe / Slice of Life (清新/透明感)**: `@kantoku` (格子裙/明亮/高光细腻), `@anmi` (通透/柔软线条/空气感), `@hiten` (日常光影/发丝细腻), `@tiv` (韩漫风/淡雅), `@40hara` (生活感/猫娘), `@fly` (蓝天白云/清爽).\n* **Semi-Realism / Thick Paint (厚涂/半写实)**: `@wlop` (史诗感/强侧光/金属质感), `@nixeu` (陶瓷肌/华丽/面部特写), `@shal.e` (神秘/红黑色调), `@guweiz` (暗调/高对比度/冷酷), `@krenz` (强透视/学院派光影).\n* **Scenery / Atmospheric (大场景/氛围)**: `@arsenixc` (逼真背景/新海诚风), `@rella` (梦幻光影/光粒子), `@yuumei` (情感环境光/宏大景观), `@demizu posuka` (细节密度/鱼眼/混乱美), `@mocha` (广阔蓝天/空间感).\n* **Pop / High-Energy / Cyber (潮流/高饱和)**: `@mika pikazo` (色彩爆炸/几何背景), `@lam` (瞳孔特写/强烈对比色/街头), `@yoneyama mai` (霓虹光效/动态模糊/现代潮流), `@tarou2` (透视夸张/波普风).\n* **Tech / Tactical / Desaturated (机能/冷淡)**: `@neco` (冷灰调/战术装备/无机质感), `@swav` (机能风/硬朗块面), `@reoen` (低饱和/概念艺术), `@redjuice` (赛博朋克/机械设定).\n* **Soft / Watercolor / Melancholic (柔和/水彩)**: `@lpip` (低饱和/时尚穿搭/淡雅), `@ds_mile` (极致透明感/治愈系), `@wataboku` (数码水彩/怀旧校服), `@morikura_en` (细腻日常/温柔).\n* **Game Art / Concept Design (游戏美术/华丽)**: `@liduke` (扎实线条/沉稳色彩), `@ask` (古典/油画感), `@fuzichoco` (极致华丽/复杂服饰纹理).\n\n## Output Format:\n请直接输出一段可以直接复制的英文提示词，不要包含任何多余的解释、分析过程或代码块标记。\n\n**标准输出结构：**\nmasterpiece, best quality, score_9, score_8, highres, 2025, newest, safe, source_anime, @[画师名]. [融合指令后的角色外貌自然语言长句]. [融合指令后的动作与服饰自然语言长句]. [融合指令后的环境与光影氛围自然语言长句].\n\n现在，请等待我提供【一张图片】以及【（可选）修改指令/指定画师】，并开始工作。", "one by one", 24, 256, 281010301767242, "randomize", true, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 34, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 35, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 58, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "link": 36, "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "force_offload", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "force_offload"}, {"widget": {"name": "save_states"}, "name": "save_states", "label": "save_states", "ty